    "mid_* and far_* are visually close (far is only slightly more turned).",
    "Jump from center (true rear view) to mid_* (three-quarter view) is large, so the swap will be noticeable.",
    "Source art is about 250 px wide per cannon; fine for phone sizes, soft if scaled well beyond ~1.5x.",
    "Mirroring also mirrors the painted lighting, so right-side highlights fall on the opposite side. Usually unnoticeable in play."
